            "review_text": "The Lady D Travels\nLondon, United Kingdom257 contributions\n1\nLovely setting; great food\nSep 2019 • Friends\nI read about this restaurant on Condé Nast’s Travel guide as a great place for dinner. And as always CNTraveller was correct: we had an excellent experience. The staff were friendly and very welcoming. They have a decent wine list (one of the only places we found a half bottle of champagne). The food was yummy, traditional Vietnamese dishes. I recommend that you sit in the back near the water feature wall — it’s quite magical.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 15, 2019",
