            "review_text": "suntan47\nChelmsford, United Kingdom1306 contributions\n0\nEnjoyable Dinner\nMar 2019 • Couples\nVisited as part of a tour group, so had a set Dinner Menu provided. There are lots of courses but thankfully they are not too large. I am sure there were Spring Rolls, soup, rice, vegetables ,fish , chicken ,meat , noodles , followed by fresh fruit & coffee / tea. We were a group of 23, service was good but fairly fast.\n\nHad we just been a couple we would rather have taken another 30 minutes or so over our dinner.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 5, 2019",
