            "review_text": "Glyn F\nBurton upon Trent, United Kingdom607 contributions\n0\nNice setting, average food\nJan 2019 • Friends\nThe wild rice restaurant is located in a traditional colonial style building. Dining is available on the ground floor or the first floor in separate function rooms. The food was not outstanding, but pleasant nevertheless. I'm not entirely sure about the crab and corn soup which seemed quite gelatinous. One of our party was saved tofu and mushroom soup in place of a seafood course. This proved totally inedible. However the reminder of the courses, went down very well and overall, it was a pleasant experience\nRead more\nWritten January 26, 2019",
